    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi"><head>ΨΥΧΑΓΩΓΟΙ</head>
          <pb n="608" facs="urn:hathi:iau.31858007086675:scan:616"/>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="255" xml:id="frag_ebc8dc4693" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:275">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Homeri Odyss. λ, 134. Αἰσχύλος ἐν Ψυχαγωγοῖς</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_ebc8dc4693-l1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐρωδιὸς γὰρ ὑψόθει ποτώμενος</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="frag_ebc8dc4693-l2" xml:lang="grc">ὄνθῳ σε πλήξει, νηδύος χειλώμασιν.</l>
              <l n="3" xml:id="frag_ebc8dc4693-l3" xml:lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦδ᾽ ἄκανθα ποντίου βοσκήματος</l>
              <l n="4" xml:id="frag_ebc8dc4693-l4" xml:lang="grc">σήψει παλαιὸν δέρμα καὶ τριχορρυές.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="source">Vide Valckenar. Diatrib. p. 286.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="256" xml:id="frag_10bcb8b25b" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:273">
            <note type="source">Aristophanes Ranar. v. 1297.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_10bcb8b25b-l1" xml:lang="grc">Ἑρμᾶν μὲν πρόγονον τίομεν γένος οἱ περὶ λίμναν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="source">ubi scholiasta, ἐκ τῶν Αἰσχύλου Ψυχαγωγῶν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="257" xml:id="frag_1dc394ea43" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:278">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Δρώπτειν: διακόπτειν, ἢ διασκοπεῖν. Αἰσχύλος Ψυχαγωγοῖς.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="258" xml:id="frag_5defe7caab" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:274">
            <note type="source">Pollux X, 10.</note>
            <quote>Αὐτὸ μὲν γὰρ τοὔνομα τῆς σκευοθήκης εὕροις ἂν ἐν τοῖς Αἰσχύλου Ψυχαγωγοῖς</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_5defe7caab-l1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ σκευοθηκῶν ναυτικῶν τ᾽ ἐρειπίων.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="259" xml:id="frag_12ee1254aa" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:276">
            <note type="source">Photius p. 534, 1.</note>
            <quote>Σταθερόν: τινὲς καὶ ἐπὶ τοῦ στασίμου, ὡς Αἰσχύλος ἐν Ψυχαγωγοῖς “Σταθεροῦ χεύματος.”</quote>
            <note type="source">Apud Suidam χρήματος.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="260" xml:id="frag_538dd8e7c7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:psychagogoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.psychagogoi.nauck1889-grc1:277">
            <note type="source">Schol. Apollon. III, 846.</note>
            <quote>Ὅτι δὲ τὴν Δαῖραν Περσεφόνην καλοῦσι Τιμοσθένης ἐν τῷ Ἐξηγητικῷ συγκατατίθεται καὶ Αἰσχύλος ἐν Ψυχαγωγοῖς ἐμφαίνει, τὴν Περσεφόνην ἐκδεχόμενος Δαῖραν.</quote>
            <note type="source">Conf. Eustathium p. 648, 40.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
